LICENCE FOR THE TRAINED WEIGHTS IN THIS DIRECTORY
=================================================

The CODE in this repository is Apache License 2.0 (see ../LICENSE).
The WEIGHTS in this directory are NOT, and this file says why.

WHAT FXTD STUDIOS GRANTS
------------------------
FXTD Studios owns the training procedure, the architecture, and the effort
that produced these files, and grants you a non-exclusive, royalty-free
licence to use, copy, modify and redistribute them for any purpose,
including commercially, subject to the one condition below.

THE CONDITION
-------------
These weights were trained on a mixed corpus. One of its sources carries a
term FXTD Studios cannot waive on your behalf:

  Poly Haven HDRIs            CC0                  no restriction
                              https://polyhaven.com/license

  HdM-HDR-2014                free for ACADEMIC and educational use;
  HdM-HFR-2017                COMMERCIAL use requires a separate licence
                              agreement with Hochschule der Medien Stuttgart
                              https://hdm-stuttgart.de/vmlab/hdm-hdr-2014/

  Netflix Chimera             CC BY 4.0 -- requires attribution
                              https://opencontent.netflix.com/

  FXTD Studios footage        proprietary; licensed to you as part of these
                              weights, no separate permission needed

If you intend to use these weights COMMERCIALLY, satisfy the HdM term first.
Contact HdM Stuttgart via the dataset page above. FXTD Studios' grant does
not extend to it and cannot.

If you use these weights at all, the Netflix Chimera attribution rides along:
credit "Netflix Open Content, CC BY 4.0" wherever you credit the sources.

WHICH FILES THIS COVERS
-----------------------
Every .pt file in this directory, and the corresponding files published at
https://huggingface.co/fxtdstudios/RUDRA. The .json files, the checksums and
this README are Apache 2.0 with the rest of the repository.

WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
--------------------
Until 5 September 2026 these weights were published under the repository's
blanket Apache 2.0, which told every reader that commercial use was fine.
That was a claim FXTD Studios was not in a position to make. Whether trained
weights are a derivative work of their training data is unsettled and varies
by jurisdiction -- but HdM's terms are a contract accepted at download, and a
contract binds regardless of how that question is eventually answered.

A CLEAN ALTERNATIVE IS COMING
-----------------------------
`pipeline/render_hdri_moves.py` generates training pairs from the 963 CC0
Poly Haven panoramas alone. Weights retrained on CC0 material plus FXTD's own
footage carry no upstream condition at all, and are the intended replacement
for these. See STATUS.md.

NOT LEGAL ADVICE
----------------
This file describes provenance and points at the upstream terms. It is not
legal advice, and it is not a substitute for reading them.
